Say, === 33. Statistics ===
Get median of [1, 2, 3, 4, 100] as med.
Show med.
Get mode of [1, 1, 2, 3] as mode_val.
Show mode_val.
Get standard deviation of [2, 4, 4, 4, 5, 5, 7, 9] as stdev_val.
Show stdev_val.

